####################### adding advisors

@add_advisors
title: Add advisors
choose-if: n_advisors < 3
unavailable-subtitle: Maximum of 3 advisors.
go-to: advisor_menu

@advisor_menu
title: Add other advisors.
tags: marxist_leninist_advisor, right_opposition_advisor, left_opposition_advisor, conciliator_advisor left_advisor, reformist_advisor, nonfactional_advisor
frequency: 1


- @marxist_leninist: Add Marxist Leninists
- @left_opposition: Add Left Oppositionists
- @right_opposition: Add Right Oppositionists
- @conciliator: Add Conciliators
- @left: Add Leftists
- @reformist: Add Reformists
- @nonfactional: Add non-factional advisors
- @rm_main: Remove advisors instead.
- @remove_none: Stop changing advisors.


@marxist_leninist
view-if: n_advisors < 3

