# marxist_leninist

@add_thalmann
title: Ernst Thälmann
subtitle: Ernst Thälmann is the chairman of both the KPD and RFB as well as being on the Comintern's executive commitee. {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Building the RFB, International Relations, Party Discipline ?]
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/ThälmannErnst.jpg
view-if: thalmann_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3
on-arrival: thalmann_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu
tags: marxist_leninist_advisor

Ernst Thälmann is now an advisor.

@add_ulbricht
title: Walter Ulbricht
subtitle: Walter Ulbricht is one of our most talented organizers and a member of the Reichstag. {!<br><br>!}[? if difficulty < 0 : Actions - Clear the Agenda, Cell Organizing, Party Discipline ?]
