card-image: img/portraits/UlbrichtWalter.jpg
view-if: ulbricht_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3
on-arrival: ulbricht_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu
tags: marxist_leninist_advisor

Ulbricht is now an advisor.

