card-image: img/portraits/NeumannHeinz.jpg
view-if: neumann_advisor = 0 and n_advisors < 3
on-arrival: neumann_advisor = 1; n_advisors += 1
go-to: advisor_menu
tags: marxist_leninist_advisor

Neumann is now an advisor.

@add_pieck
